@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+<html><body>Дориан:<br>
+Положили цветок к надгробию? Заметили, кто похоронен в той могиле?<br>
+<a action="bypass Script Q00024_InhabitantsOfTheForestOfTheDead 31389-06.html">Нидра</a><br>
+<a action="bypass Script Q00024_InhabitantsOfTheForestOfTheDead 31389-07.html">Лидия</a><br>
+<a action="bypass Script Q00024_InhabitantsOfTheForestOfTheDead 31389-08.html">Роза</a>
+</body></html>
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/dist/game/data/lang/ru/data/scripts/quests/Q00024_InhabitantsOfTheForestOfTheDead/31389-06.html b/dist/game/data/lang/ru/data/scripts/quests/Q00024_InhabitantsOfTheForestOfTheDead/31389-06.html
