+<a action="bypass -h Script Q00144_PailakaInjuredDragon -8">Focus Lv3</a><br>
+<a action="bypass -h Script Q00144_PailakaInjuredDragon -9">Death Whisper Lv3</a><br>
+<a action="bypass -h Script Q00144_PailakaInjuredDragon -10">Berserker Spirit Lv2</a><br>
