+<a action="bypass Script Q00350_EnhanceYourWeapon 30115-09.htm">Red Soul Crystal</a><br>
+<a action="bypass Script Q00350_EnhanceYourWeapon 30115-10.htm">Green Soul Crystal</a><br>
+<a action="bypass Script Q00350_EnhanceYourWeapon 30115-11.htm">Blue Soul Crystal</a><br>
