+Найден запертый Treasure Chest!<br>
+<a action="bypass Script Q00383_TreasureHunt 31148-02.html">Открыть.</a>
+</body></html>
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/dist/game/data/lang/ru/data/scripts/quests/Q00383_TreasureHunt/31148-02.html b/dist/game/data/lang/ru/data/scripts/quests/Q00383_TreasureHunt/31148-02.html
