+<a action="bypass Script Q00508_AClansReputation 30868-2.html">Жрец Шилен Хисилром</a><br>
+<a action="bypass Script Q00508_AClansReputation 30868-3.html">Повелитель Гаргулий Тифон</a><br>
+<a action="bypass Script Q00508_AClansReputation 30868-4.html">Последний Малый Гигант Глаки</a><br>
+<a action="bypass Script Q00508_AClansReputation 30868-5.html">Рахха</a><br>
+<a action="bypass Script Q00508_AClansReputation 30868-6.html">Flamestone Giant</a>
+</body></html>
