+<html><body>Пастух Тунатун:<br>
+Выбирайте! Выбор у меня огромный, наверняка что-нибудь понравится!<br>
+<a action="bypass -h Script Q00631_DeliciousTopChoiceMeat 0">15 шт. Mold Glue</a><br>
+<a action="bypass -h Script Q00631_DeliciousTopChoiceMeat 1">15 шт. Asofe</a><br>
+<a action="bypass -h Script Q00631_DeliciousTopChoiceMeat 2">15 шт. Thons</a><br>
+<a action="bypass -h Script Q00631_DeliciousTopChoiceMeat 3">10 шт. Mold Lubricant</a><br>
+<a action="bypass -h Script Q00631_DeliciousTopChoiceMeat 4">10 шт. Enrias</a><br>
+<a action="bypass -h Script Q00631_DeliciousTopChoiceMeat 5">5 шт. Mold Hardener</a>
+</body></html>
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/dist/game/data/lang/ru/data/scripts/quests/Q00631_DeliciousTopChoiceMeat/31537-06.htm b/dist/game/data/lang/ru/data/scripts/quests/Q00631_DeliciousTopChoiceMeat/31537-06.htm
