+<a action="bypass Script Q00709_PathToBecomingALordDion 31418-05.html">Отдать ему Корни Мандрагоры.</a>
+</body></html>
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/dist/game/data/lang/ru/data/scripts/quests/Q00709_PathToBecomingALordDion/31418-04a.html b/dist/game/data/lang/ru/data/scripts/quests/Q00709_PathToBecomingALordDion/31418-04a.html
