+<a action="bypass -h Script DarkElfChange1 1">Сменить профессию на Ассасина</a><br>
+<a action="bypass Script DarkElfChange1 30297-01.html">Вернуться</a>
+</body></html>
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/dist/game/data/lang/ru/data/scripts/village_master/DarkElfChange1/30297-06.html b/dist/game/data/lang/ru/data/scripts/village_master/DarkElfChange1/30297-06.html
